      "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2021 the Syndicate's gross claims outstanding were GBP 3,340.2m. During 2021 there was a net prior-year release of GBP 67.7m (gross), driven by favourable reserve development in the Insurance and Reinsurance divisions (including releases in Cargo, Marine Liability, Commercial Property and Financial Lines) which were partially offset by significant adverse development in discontinued lines (notably US trucking liability and International Casualty). COVID-19, a series of 2021 natural catastrophe events (including Hurricane Ida and the Texas freeze Uri), and inflationary concerns were highlighted as material influences on reserves and future uncertainty.",
